    "text": "Gridley Herald\nwebsite\nGridley\nGHS Tennis Bounces Back\n9 hours ago\nGRIDLEY, CA (MPG) – The tennis teams have been reinstated at Gridley High School. To recap, the announcement was made at the board meeting on May 28, that the tennis teams were being cut. Reasons for the discontinuation were given as the teams being too small, too expensive and too hard to get coaches for, according to the administrators.",
